        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Taylor Swift\n- Projects: Red, The Red Tour, State of Grace\n- Roles: singer-songwriter\n- Places: Omaha, Nebraska, Singapore\n- Topics: concert tours, studio albums, songs\n\nFacts:\n- Taylor Swift is an American singer-songwriter.\n- Taylor Swift released her fourth studio album, Red, in 2012.\n- Taylor Swift's song \"State of Grace\" is from her fourth studio album, Red.\n- The Red Tour was Taylor Swift's third concert tour and supported her fourth studio album, Red.\n- The Red Tour began on March 13, 2013 in Omaha, Nebraska.\n- Taylor Swift completed The Red Tour on June 12, 2014 in Singapore.\n- The Red Tour grossed over $150 million and became the highest-grossing tour of all time by a country artist.",
